-- Vec (+ Nat __inst_Add_71 (natOfInt (subInt (natToInt @1) 1)) 1) @2 /
-- expected Vec @1 @2) at line 34; E_UNSOLVED_IMPLICIT
-- "= Bool (subDefined Nat __inst_CheckedSub_74 @1 1) True" at line 34;
-- W_TERMINATION_UNVERIFIED on replicate. The PNat contrast checks clean.
